OL,3,GNEWSANew police station opens in Milton
OL,4,
OL,5,FA new police station near Cambridge has
OL,6,Fopened, replacing a city-centre station
OL,7,Fbuilt in the 1960s.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said its officers
OL,10,Fand staff had moved from Parkside
OL,11,FPolice Station into new premises in
OL,12,FMilton, next to the park and ride.
OL,14,FThe two-storey station includes a
OL,15,F24-cell custody suite, consultation and
OL,16,Finterview rooms, medical facilities and
OL,17,Fsecure detainee holding areas.
OL,19,FChief Constable Chris Balmer called the
OL,20,Fopening of the station a "significant
OL,21,Fmoment" for the force and the
OL,22,Fcommunity.
